945a12c7a20fbdf4a2421281961d\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "d61f6ed21dfca60a1daa511b306617ccbbff871c", "git_parents": ["a9c24d2ce20d3ffa61512b1a78ea088137f162ae"], "node": "d2b5f35e0b46abb0af4da74fdd05559a3055a6d1", "parents": ["9de9a52bb3fb73ffcc939c5dff655eb2a0f3150d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791623015, "git_changesets": ["a9c24d2ce20d3ffa61512b1a78ea088137f162ae", "d61f6ed21dfca60a1daa511b306617ccbbff871c"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28850": {"changesets": [{"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079663. Rename nsJXLDecoder::mU8RowBuf to mPipeInputRowBuf.  a=RyanVM\n\nThe name says what type it holds rather than what it is for. The next patch\nadds a second row buffer, so name this one after its role: the row we hand to\nthe surface pipe when it can't read mPixelBuffer directly.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331947\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332612\n", "files": ["image/decoders/nsJXLDecoder.cpp", "image/decoders/nsJXLDecoder.h"], "git_node": "40d84da44f2c31255d3c5df74703a5e349c117fd", "git_parents": ["d61f6ed21dfca60a1daa511b306617ccbbff871c"], "node": "cf4f85a1a7a1cc0d9ae470b03b8d32e6c326d776", "parents": ["d2b5f35e0b46abb0af4da74fdd05559a3055a6d1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079663. Don't premultiply JXL images that have premultiplied alpha a second time.  a=RyanVM\n\nhttps://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/3c71a541b0e7ac6e086907b38670dabca9174c45/image/decoders/nsJXLDecoder.cpp#607\n\nWe assume jxl-rs always outputs unpremultiplied alpha, but for images with\npremultiplied (associated) alpha it outputs the premultiplied values stored in\nthe file. We then premultiply them again, so semi-transparent areas come out\ntoo dark. Color management and surfaces that want unpremultiplied data\n(NO_PREMULTIPLY_ALPHA) also got premultiplied data.\n\nNow we unpremultiply when color management or the surface needs it, and\notherwise tell the surface pipe not to premultiply. The spec doesn't say what\ncolor values larger than alpha mean; we clamp them to alpha so the result\ndoesn't depend on whether color management runs.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331951\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332613\n", "files": ["image/decoders/nsJXLDecoder.cpp", "image/decoders/nsJXLDecoder.h"], "git_node": "c95e2831662ebee705709e2526e2a28b109bd36f", "git_parents": ["40d84da44f2c31255d3c5df74703a5e349c117fd"], "node": "07fa6d1b5d8cc37ab8ae2f65a04d4f7cd93aed2a", "parents": ["cf4f85a1a7a1cc0d9ae470b03b8d32e6c326d776"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079663. Add WPT reftests for JXL images with premultiplied alpha.  a=RyanVM\n\nPremultiplied and non-premultiplied versions of the same RGB and gray grids,\neach compared against one PNG, plus the conformance suite's\nalpha_premultiplied image compared against its reference PNG. cjxl\n--premultiply=1 only marks the pixels as premultiplied, so the premultiplied\ngrids are encoded from PNGs that were premultiplied first.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331952\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332614\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/conformance-alpha-premultiplied-reftest-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/conformance-alpha-premultiplied-reftest.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/nonpremultiplied-alpha-grid-reftest-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/nonpremultiplied-alpha-grid-reftest.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/nonpremultiplied-gray-alpha-grid-reftest-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/nonpremultiplied-gray-alpha-grid-reftest.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/premultiplied-alpha-grid-reftest-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/premultiplied-alpha-grid-reftest.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/premultiplied-gray-alpha-grid-reftest-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/premultiplied-gray-alpha-grid-reftest.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/alpha_grid.png", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/conformance_alpha_premultiplied.jxl", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/conformance_alpha_premultiplied.png", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/generate_resources.sh", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/gray_alpha_grid.png", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/nonpremultiplied_alpha_grid.jxl", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/nonpremultiplied_gray_alpha_grid.jxl", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/premultiplied_alpha_grid.jxl", "testing/web-platform/tests/jpegxl/resources/premultiplied_gray_alpha_grid.jxl"], "git_node": "6f96cc37eb97660f8ded73bcd623b12df6c4a472", "git_parents": ["c95e2831662ebee705709e2526e2a28b109bd36f"], "node": "57a5fffc326adda088e87c5b64e78bcfe0a8e715", "parents": ["07fa6d1b5d8cc37ab8ae2f65a04d4f7cd93aed2a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639430, "git_changesets": ["40d84da44f2c31255d3c5df74703a5e349c117fd", "c95e2831662ebee705709e2526e2a28b109bd36f", "6f96cc37eb97660f8ded73bcd623b12df6c4a472"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28851": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078855 - Fix FoldTests pass to mark phi operands as implicitly-used when discarding a phi.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332107\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332666\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/Boolean.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/bug2078855.js", "js/src/jit/FoldTests.cpp"], "git_node": "2a5b05ff17868b7b34426f9a4c56a097879dcb6d", "git_parents": ["6f96cc37eb97660f8ded73bcd623b12df6c4a472"], "node": "9f320a930488705fb2de0f2788785b5b6fb9065d", "parents": ["57a5fffc326adda088e87c5b64e78bcfe0a8e715"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639525, "git_changesets": ["2a5b05ff17868b7b34426f9a4c56a097879dcb6d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28852": {"changesets": [{"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079032 - Use RefPtrs for submit elements.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332169\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332503\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLFormElement.cpp", "dom/html/HTMLFormElement.h"], "git_node": "17f5759493d2a696e90bc77fa686754a7a72d664", "git_parents": ["2a5b05ff17868b7b34426f9a4c56a097879dcb6d"], "node": "43fb8363bc66ae4543ee96e2cee2826cb7c9f4d5", "parents": ["9f320a930488705fb2de0f2788785b5b6fb9065d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639561, "git_changesets": ["17f5759493d2a696e90bc77fa686754a7a72d664"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28853": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079155 - Add FinalizationRegistry registration after unwrapping the target.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332326\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332667\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/FinalizationRegistryObject.cpp"], "git_node": "6269f6021b3dfd19a9e2860ac101321b0bb621f9", "git_parents": ["17f5759493d2a696e90bc77fa686754a7a72d664"], "node": "cc2bb66507fba58fe2e190a903bee464c3d0a220", "parents": ["43fb8363bc66ae4543ee96e2cee2826cb7c9f4d5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639601, "git_changesets": ["6269f6021b3dfd19a9e2860ac101321b0bb621f9"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28854": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079709  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332265\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332598\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/nsDataDocumentContentPolicy.cpp"], "git_node": "a59417052e8e9dbe82dd413917164454f844fe71", "git_parents": ["6269f6021b3dfd19a9e2860ac101321b0bb621f9"], "node": "a92b680e302316cf9d8c9e20f74569c1d633f306", "parents": ["cc2bb66507fba58fe2e190a903bee464c3d0a220"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639703, "git_changesets": ["a59417052e8e9dbe82dd413917164454f844fe71"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28855": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079924 - Check for NS_STATE_SVG_TEXT_CORRESPONDENCE_DIRTY too  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332190\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332596\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/svg/SVGObserverUtils.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/text/crashtests/unicode-bidi-crash.html"], "git_node": "00ebc44eee84a8365d13eeaabc3bf05b690ccccf", "git_parents": ["a59417052e8e9dbe82dd413917164454f844fe71"], "node": "cc77ee7b9a65b0560840917055609a35f6f827c9", "parents": ["a92b680e302316cf9d8c9e20f74569c1d633f306"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791639762, "git_changesets": ["00ebc44eee84a8365d13eeaabc3bf05b690ccccf"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28856": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jens Stutte \u003cjstutte@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076875 - Serialize requests to the shared fix-stacks process.  a=RyanVM\n\nTest harnesses call fixSymbols from several threads, e.g. parallel xpcshell\ntests and self-tests. Unserialized, a thread can read another thread's answer\nor none at all, which garbles or hangs stack fixing.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330900\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332701\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/source-test/python.yml", "tools/moz.build", "tools/rb/fix_stacks