ed\n--toolbarbutton-icon-fill for their text, which fails the contrast checks.\nUse --text-color for the labels and keep the icon colors and the non-Nova\nstyling unchanged.\n\nCherry pick pdf.js changes from https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/commit/e85d65a8e5e90151ba4627579b514a6206f6a588.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333995\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/web/viewer.css"], "git_node": "a8c9d51f64a1142f615428f289f64a4db69a2766", "git_parents": ["d470c91e8ccde619d108907a5ae76724ea0c658a"], "node": "803d3b9ebabbacde1f8e4fa8c739c4847293574e", "parents": ["50a2f01185b636a3c1482f1f877cf60cf4cc2640"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792069627, "git_changesets": ["a8c9d51f64a1142f615428f289f64a4db69a2766"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28961": {"changesets": [{"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080272 - Make `IMContextWrapper::DispatchCompositionChangeEvent` check `mContentSelection.isSome()` at collapsing selection to expected position  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332722\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333931\n", "files": ["widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.cpp"], "git_node": "8df8e14505d57897308707106fae61f736e1e62c", "git_parents": ["a8c9d51f64a1142f615428f289f64a4db69a2766"], "node": "de8a2bbf0e360eed7a70584247ea15f0175a2960", "parents": ["803d3b9ebabbacde1f8e4fa8c739c4847293574e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792069661, "git_changesets": ["8df8e14505d57897308707106fae61f736e1e62c"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28962": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061509 - Do not serialize Set-Cookie headers  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333007\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334003\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/PHttpC