"git_changesets": ["3e707dcb68261fc94532fa5002cd60d7be644bf7"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28975": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update remote-settings mobile-experiments mobile-merino-manifest ct-logs -  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334289\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/service/merino-manifest/src/main/assets/manifest/manifest.json", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_experiments.json", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/addons-mlbf.bin", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/addons-mlbf.bin.meta.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/softblocks-addons-mlbf.bin", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters/softblocks-addons-mlbf.bin.meta.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/ai-window-prompts.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "toolkit/components/certviewer/content/components/logNameTable.mjs"], "git_node": "b2e1c79e3d4ec52bc675e9ef3950fbcdcd2899da", "git_parents": ["3e707dcb68261fc94532fa5002cd60d7be644bf7"], "node": "6e76c7f52c8346d3961fa31fe094b74a73defd89", "parents": ["58bd12b1538f3a2897801e6ec4491e20052debed"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792095188, "git_changesets": ["b2e1c79e3d4ec52bc675e9ef3950fbcdcd2899da"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28976": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079036 - Clamp damage area in nsTableCellFrame::DidSetComputedStyle.  a=RyanVM\n\n(original patch provided by clauditor)\n\nThe col-span clamp in nsTableCellFrame::DidSetComputedStyle here is sufficient\nto fix the reported issue; but given the complexity of table and border-collapse\ncode in general, the precaution of clamping in nsTableFrame::ExpandBCDamageArea\nseems worthwhile for a little extra hardening.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332732\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334291\n", "files": ["layout/tables/nsTableCellFrame.cpp", "layout/tables/nsTableFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-tables/crashtests/border-collapse-dynamic-crash.html"], "git_node": "a5db414e98ee346704f38850e7f4eb0c11c880ae", "git_parents": ["b2e1c79e3d4ec52bc675e9ef3950fbcdcd2899da"], "node": "e6b23b50d03a7ee95b60bfb1152ab836d9451fd0", "parents": ["6e76c7f52c8346d3961fa31fe094b74a73defd89"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792096228, "git_changesets": ["a5db414e98ee346704f38850e7f4eb0c11c880ae"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28977": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from main\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-bg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-eu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-fr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-gl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-ko/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-pt-rPT/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-sv-rSE/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-bg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-cy/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-de/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-es-rAR/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fi/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-fr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-gl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ia/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ko/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-pt-rPT/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sk/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sl/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-sv-rSE/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tr/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-hsb/strings.xml"], "git_node": "5324b49fcc6681c9023b30e941437dd4caf32a2d", "git_parents": ["a5db414e98ee346704f38850e7f4eb0c11c880ae"], "node": "83066a6c6d29bdb3ce997d1e22aec04817d0a68b", "parents": ["e6b23b50d03a7ee95b60bfb1152ab836d9451fd0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792117041, "git_changesets": ["5324b49fcc6681c9023b30e941437dd4caf32a2d"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28978": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081454 - Bump Application Services to 159.0.1. a=RyanVM\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/ApplicationServices.kt"], "git_node": "ec4b4caf80f849fdb177ffd2634c687d0b5fbcb9", "git_parents": ["5324b49fcc6681c9023b30e941437dd4caf32a2d"], "node": "7b97b4b07412e47033dde5bafb9580751952edcf", "parents": ["83066a6c6d29bdb3ce997d1e22aec04817d0a68b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792118488, "git_changesets": ["ec4b4caf80f849fdb177ffd2634c687d0b5fbcb9"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28979": {"changesets": [{"author": "John Lin \u003cjolin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068878 - Use Media3 stream formats when sizing HLS video buffers.  a=RyanVM\n\nUse BaseRenderer.getStreamFormats() to include the stream's compatible\nformats when calculating maximum video dimensions and input buffer size.\nRemove the local format cache and its obsolete onStreamChanged callback.\n\nWhen the maximum input size is unknown, leave the input buffer unset\ninstead of attempting to allocate an array with Format.NO_VALUE as its\nsize. This allows the decoder input buffer to allocate storage when the\nsample size becomes known, including for AV1 streams.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325729\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334299\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/media/GeckoHlsVideoRenderer.java"], "git_node": "912310717e68c11d3ed9393d6f2d14d317db5389", "git_parents": ["ec4b4caf80f849fdb177ffd2634c687d0b5fbcb9"], "node": "2fbf8c58b73136afc4b5604f4b0b14c8c287b79f", "parents": ["7b97b4b07412e47033dde5bafb9580751952edcf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "John Lin \u003cjolin@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068878 - Only prepend HLS codec initialization data to H.264/H.265 keyframes.  a=RyanVM\n\nRestrict CSD prepending to codecs whose Annex B parameter sets are valid in-band data, preserving the original sample data for AV1 and other codecs.\n\nAdd a shared accessor for the current input format and reuse it for buffer sizing, sample preparation, and error reporting.\n\nRemove the video renderer's reconfiguration state machine, which inserted raw `Format.initializationData` (an av1C record for AV1) into the bitstream after format changes; keyframe CSD prepending already covers H.264/H.265.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325730\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334300\n", "files": ["mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/media/GeckoHlsAudioRenderer.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/media/GeckoHlsRendererBase.java", "mobile/android/geckoview/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/media/GeckoHlsVideoRenderer.java"], "git_node": "0fc183d6fd49c9db88cd90f683dcdbabbf759c89", "git_parents": ["912310717e68c11d3ed9393d6f2d14d317db5389"], "node": "4f9d87726e484c506a393cf03b7723cf0bfc916a", "parents": ["2fbf8c58b73136afc4b5604f4b0b14c8c287b79f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792118799, "git_changesets": ["912310717e68c11d3ed9393d6f2d14d317db5389", "0fc183d6fd49c9db88cd90f683dcdbabbf759c89"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28980": {"changesets": [{"author": "Makoto Kato \u003cm_kato@ga2.so-net.ne.jp\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079809 - TriggerInitialTranslation should handle errors correctly.  a=RyanVM\n\nAccording to crash data, it isn't enough to handle errors.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333069\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozi