: {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079054 - Use the current document in ScreenOrientation::MaybeChanged after firing mozorientationchange.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334050\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334557\n", "files": ["dom/base/ScreenOrientation.cpp"], "git_node": "0312384cd0ab84fe35613f71280076ab6070e1ea", "git_parents": ["ab96d1dd98a9a65cfa55359d65d397c661b3d66b"], "node": "89c555daf71a1850300e1d5687fcc1bb66194b4f", "parents": ["466aa894aa783109dbb5f35b5aa4660ec442643f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792160972, "git_changesets": ["0312384cd0ab84fe35613f71280076ab6070e1ea"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28993": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079255.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334059\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334462\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsBlockFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-multicol/crashtests/block-break-before.html"], "git_node": "952bbe50a7d2c08d5ed888da9ba768ed415996a0", "git_parents": ["0312384cd0ab84fe35613f71280076ab6070e1ea"], "node": "dcfec4a1534e93530d562ac9082099d44a64668d", "parents": ["89c555daf71a1850300e1d5687fcc1bb66194b4f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792161009, "git_changesets": ["952bbe50a7d2c08d5ed888da9ba768ed415996a0"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28994": {"changesets": [{"author": "parker \u003c36695574+camilapedraza@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081925 - Restore string comment mistakenly  a=RyanVM\n\nDeletion occured in https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331515\nString A was removed but comment for string B was removed with it, and comment for string A left instead. In the github diff, it is rendered as an update to the comment of string B. This patch restores the original comment of string B.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333828\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334145\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"], "git_node": "66bb41903f2ce66b5a1168faeb49ce6bb15bc5f8", "git_parents": ["952bbe50a7d2c08d5ed888da9ba768ed415996a0"], "node": "ef1a48a514fe102a89687b03b793310cbc1af06b", "parents": ["dcfec4a1534e93530d562ac9082099d44a64668d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792165158, "git_changesets": ["66bb41903f2ce66b5a1168faeb49ce6bb15bc5f8"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28995": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081985 - Make sure @position-try inside scope doesn't allow more than it should.  a=RyanVM\n\nEnsure that we're allowed in all the rules we're supposed to. Fix some\nplaces which allowed a rule in style but not in scope, which seems\nan oversight (see next patch for more reliable fix).\n\nThe test has one failure, which is for @page inside @scope, because\nthat's the only case where inner rules can be less restrictive than\nouter rules.\n\nThat failure will really go away when we ever make `size` a proper\nshorthand for width and height, but we can fix in a follow-up if\nneeded by splitting the bitflag check in two.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334116\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334499\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/parser.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/data.py", "servo/components/style/properties/mod.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/properties.mako.rs", "servo/components/style/properties/shorthands.toml", "servo/components/style/stylesheets/mod.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-cascade/declaration-context.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-cascade/declaration-context.html"], "git_node": "4a9a62ac9936d2d9b3d7a32daf2a95e05309a74d", "git_parents": ["66bb41903f2ce66b5a1168faeb49ce6bb15bc5f8"], "node": "073930246f51be92b00277c4c6eb7e15629234cb", "parents": ["ef1a48a514fe102a89687b03b793310cbc1af06b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792165194, "git_changesets": ["4a9a62ac9936d2d9b3d7a32daf2a95e05309a74d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28996": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082005 - Initialize cx in FirstSubsumedFrame's move constructor.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333987\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334506\n", "files": ["js/public/Stack.h", "js/src/jsapi-tests/testSavedStacks.cpp"], "git_node": "c4835716ff24efe0d5ba6d1d89521a4a0360770b", "git_parents": ["4a9a62ac9936d2d9b3d7a32daf2a95e05309a74d"], "node": "34431c7fb5412bd78ff9eb93c0c717ca69b44cb3", "parents": ["073930246f51be92b00277c4c6eb7e15629234cb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792165226, "git_changesets": ["c4835716ff24efe0d5ba6d1d89521a4a0360770b"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28997": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082072 - Bring back the old annotation for window.screen,  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334035\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334051\n", "files": ["dom/webidl/Window.webidl"], "git_node": "2ec62a7084dce4fc7e8161353094cad8fcaf82e4", "git_parents": ["c4835716ff24efe0d5ba6d1d89521a4a0360770b"], "node": "2eecf0992f3c9c1753b35ef0d943e904a8dce926", "parents": ["34431c7fb5412bd78ff9eb93c0c717ca69b44cb3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792165261, "git_changesets": ["2ec62a7084dce4fc7e8161353094cad8fcaf82e4"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28998": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082051 - Don't enter fun_call's realm in the Ion generic call trampoline.  a=RyanVM\n\nThe generic call trampoline now only switches realms right before invoking\neither a `JSNative` callee or a JIT callee.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334047\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334512\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/call-generic-fun-call-realm.js", "js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp"], "git_node": "7df9f2bbd49502b37dc7657d63a10e3721219f42", "git_parents": ["2ec62a7084dce4fc7e8161353094cad8fcaf82e4"], "node": "5b21c32f40fdca8f29b7b685ac843ec3ba622fed", "parents": ["2eecf0992f3c9c1753b35ef0d943e904a8dce926"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792165297, "git_changesets": ["7df9f2bbd49502b37dc7657d63a10e3721219f42"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28999": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c87b810aa1f3f79bc24bc4294061826c24051448 with DEVEDITION_159_0b3_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "4ba390331577bce217ce6e4eebcdcfe4922ff5b6", "git_parents": ["841567e2918fe15ea13388d9728a510136b39bdb"], "node": "5b16428a1ed07983ec124099e410195c4949280e", "parents": ["3d175a1d248687833d0a746abd6f472c3f658db3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792167725, "git_changesets": ["4ba390331577bce217ce6e4eebcdcfe4922ff5b6"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29000": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c87b810aa1f3f79bc24bc4294061826c24051448 with FIREFOX_159_0b3_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "0dd3fa218003a13a22e83363ce6306d5eb1c51dd", "git_parents": ["4ba390331577bce217ce6e4eebcdcfe4922ff5b6"], "node": "7a3f241513d33798aa15c100ccc6d004041d2216", "parents": ["5b16428a1ed07983ec124099e410195c4949280e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792168047, "git_changesets": ["0dd3fa218003a13a22e83363ce6306d5eb1c51dd"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "29001": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update HSTS HPKP -  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334646\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": "ff9df476e51bf141b246eba464cb5c274d1b038d", "git_parents": ["7df9f2bbd49502b37dc7657d63a10e3721219f42"], "node": "c8f9936eee0cfdd86f5d0c28558e98050398ca3e", "parents": ["5b21c32f40fdca8f29b7b685ac843ec3ba622fed"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792178674, "git_changesets": ["ff9df476e51bf141b246eba464cb5c274d1b038d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "29002": {"changesets": [{"author": "Boris Chiou \u003cboris.chiou@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081998 - Flush before retriving body for scrollingElement in quirks mode.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333968\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334630\n", "files": ["dom/animation/ScrollTimeline.cpp", "dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/Document.h"], "git_node": "e5216c8142ba3321b588be9822c66acd8f784364", "git_parents": ["ff9df476e51bf141b246eba464cb5c274d1b038d"], "node": "7cd71f96a7feadf95dce14649576562a03f4cba0", "parents": ["c8f9936eee0cfdd86f5d0c28558e98050398ca3e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792178811, "git_changesets": ["e5216c8142ba3321b588be9822c66acd8f784364"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "29003": {"changesets": [{"author": "Heitor Neiva \u003chneiva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079560 - Avoid a quadratic slowdown in mbsdiff on long duplicated data.  a=RyanVM\n\nThe macOS universal XUL holds its architecture-independent data twice. When\nthe copy mbsdiff is following is only 1-10 bytes worse than the other one,\nthe scan loop calls search() once per byte of the run, and the 156.x -\u003e 158.0\nXUL diffs took over 5 hours. Taking any exact match of at least 64 KiB ends\nthat crawl; the output only changes where the scan would otherwise get stuck.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332128\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334597\n", "files": ["other-licenses/bsdiff/bsdiff.c"], "git_node": "f25b8ebbc17cda569055f5bba73cdb4a44b5e745", "git_parents": ["e5216c8142ba3321b588be9822c66acd8f784364"], "node": "b1b67c35c47f7dd83a57efc3a7e6a808029d7537", "parents": ["7cd71f96a7feadf95dce14649576562a03f4cba0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792178863, "git_changesets": ["f25b8ebbc17cda569055f5bba73cdb4a44b5e745"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "29004": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080718: Always remove progress listeners on rejected promise.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333543\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334615\n", "files": ["dom/clients/manager/ClientOpenWindowUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "d7c4fd48b1c5ca42695a620c5e84b3acb3541bff", "git_parents": ["f25b8ebbc17cda569055f5bba73cdb4a44b5e745"], "node": "cf6df55a424628d2edb052c91cea127f856c1a69", "parents": ["b1b67c35c47f7dd83a57efc3a7e6a808029d7537"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792178896, "git_changesets": ["d7c4fd48b1c5ca42695a620c5e84b3acb3541bff"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "29005": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080118 - Correctly QI continuation state  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334056\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334437\n", "files": ["extensions/auth/nsHttpNegotiateAuth.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpChannelAuthProvider.cpp"], "git_node": "e658642efd5d0930edd43a408b